{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上11時許，警方接報指香港仔南寧街一間超級市場冒出濃煙，懷疑發生火警。</p><p>消防接報到場時，火警已被救熄，事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p><p>經調查後，相信是上址一間超級市場的廚房起火，火警並無可疑。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:18:47.260178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:32.387941+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:34.524638+00:00","content_hash":"5d020ededc11fe7bc8efb641dbc1de54835a43356072a7a599fd7de20b21a716","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}